00:16:14.450 --> 00:16:15.070
Riria!

00:16:16.740 --> 00:16:18.490
Papa!

00:16:18.490 --> 00:16:19.660
Riria!

00:16:23.170 --> 00:16:24.080
Riria!

00:16:27.000 --> 00:16:27.880
Riria...

00:16:28.550 --> 00:16:29.710
She's just knocked out.

00:16:29.710 --> 00:16:31.170
Thank goodness...

00:16:34.680 --> 00:16:35.590
Damn them!

00:16:41.480 --> 00:16:44.350
Flit, Emily! Take care of Riria!

00:16:44.350 --> 00:16:45.770
Mr. Iwark?

00:16:45.770 --> 00:16:48.730
Today, they're going to pay!

00:16:48.730 --> 00:16:50.860
Mr. Iwark, don't be reckless!

00:16:51.690 --> 00:16:53.240
Mr. Iwark!

00:16:53.240 --> 00:16:54.490
Flit...

00:16:54.490 --> 00:16:56.870
He can't do it in that mobile suit.

00:16:57.320 --> 00:16:58.620
What's going to happen to him?

00:17:11.000 --> 00:17:13.840
War is making people suffer again...{moralfag}{pain leads to suffering...}

00:17:15.510 --> 00:17:16.680
Vargas!

00:17:16.680 --> 00:17:18.350
What's wrong, Flit?

00:17:18.350 --> 00:17:21.310
I've encountered a mobile suit battle in the Altarka area.

00:17:21.310 --> 00:17:22.520
I need the Gundam!

00:17:23.310 --> 00:17:25.560
Using the Gundam inside the colony...

00:17:25.560 --> 00:17:29.150
Please, Vargas! I'll explain later!

00:17:45.660 --> 00:17:47.960
I'll make you all pay!

00:17:47.960 --> 00:17:50.340
If it weren't for you...

00:17:52.630 --> 00:17:55.220
At this rate, Mr. Iwark is going to...

00:17:55.220 --> 00:17:56.430
Where's Vargas? {is he talking to Vargas? or just like "Is Vargas still not here?"}

00:18:00.680 --> 00:18:02.140
I'm here, Flit!

00:18:02.140 --> 00:18:03.810
Vargas!

00:18:18.320 --> 00:18:19.570
I'm not done yet!

00:18:19.570 --> 00:18:24.910
It's because of you... because of your absurd fights...

00:18:29.040 --> 00:18:32.340
Mr. Iwark, can you hear me? It's Flit!

00:18:33.130 --> 00:18:33.750
Flit?

00:18:34.130 --> 00:18:35.630
A mobile suit?

00:18:35.630 --> 00:18:38.930
Are you piloting that mobile suit?

00:18:39.630 --> 00:18:43.600
Please get back, Mr. Iwark! You can't win with that mobile suit!

00:18:43.600 --> 00:18:46.770
What are you talking about? Do you know what I had to go through to get—

00:18:46.770 --> 00:18:48.230
But it's a worker type!

00:18:48.230 --> 00:18:49.850
It can't fight!

00:18:57.740 --> 00:18:59.570
That mobile suit's finished.

00:18:59.570 --> 00:19:01.200
Get out and go somewhere safe!

00:19:01.200 --> 00:19:03.910
Adults can't run away and let kids do the fighting for them!

00:19:04.660 --> 00:19:06.870
It doesn't matter whether you're an adult or a kid! {19:13}

00:19:06.870 --> 00:19:09.250
You need to survive, no matter what!

00:19:09.250 --> 00:19:10.120
But...

00:19:10.120 --> 00:19:12.630
Do you want to leave Riria all alone?

00:19:13.540 --> 00:19:16.130
Riria needs you.

00:19:18.800 --> 00:19:19.840
Mr. Iwark...

00:19:20.510 --> 00:19:21.550
You're right.

00:19:31.770 --> 00:19:32.770
Flit...

00:19:36.650 --> 00:19:39.530
The DODS rifle will damage the city.

00:19:46.990 --> 00:19:49.160
Who is he?

00:19:49.160 --> 00:19:50.790
He's just a boy.

00:19:53.040 --> 00:19:56.170
Flit is... just a boy.

00:19:57.500 --> 00:19:59.590
There's a battle underway in the residential area.

00:19:59.970 --> 00:20:02.010
These are the civil wars of Fardain...

00:20:02.010 --> 00:20:04.340
Skirmishes between Zalam and Euba.

00:20:04.340 --> 00:20:06.680
What a foolish colony. {foolish, they overuse the word stupid}{you're stupid xD}

00:20:06.680 --> 00:20:07.720
The Gundam?!

00:20:08.430 --> 00:20:11.890
Why is the Gundam deployed there? Nobody told me!

00:20:14.150 --> 00:20:15.860
So...

00:20:15.860 --> 00:20:18.690
What are you trying to do?

00:20:18.690 --> 00:20:20.280
Destroy the UE stronghold.

00:20:20.280 --> 00:20:21.450
What?

00:20:21.450 --> 00:20:23.660
And to do it, I need military strength.

00:20:25.780 --> 00:20:27.620
You're an interesting man.

00:20:32.790 --> 00:20:34.370
They're withdrawing...

00:20:39.340 --> 00:20:40.630
That mobile suit!

00:20:40.630 --> 00:20:42.300
Is it the UE?!

00:20:42.670 --> 00:20:46.220
And a new one? What's it doing here?

00:20:46.890 --> 00:20:50.180
Do you like watching battles too?

00:20:50.180 --> 00:20:51.480
It's the UE.

00:20:51.480 --> 00:20:52.640
What?

00:21:00.360 --> 00:21:02.530
I can't just keep dodging it!

00:21:04.200 --> 00:21:05.360
At this range...

00:21:07.950 --> 00:21:09.240
It deflected the beam?!

00:21:17.080 --> 00:21:20.000
If we keep fighting like this, the city will be destroyed! {i dont think they have towns in space...}

00:21:20.000 --> 00:21:22.420
What should I do, Gundam?!  {asking your gundam for advice is always a good idea}{I do it all the time}

00:21:22.420 --> 00:21:24.590
Is there anything for close quarters combat? {close quarters combat}

00:21:24.590 --> 00:21:27.010
The weapons are too powerful.

00:21:27.010 --> 00:21:29.430
Hand-to-hand fighting with the Gundam...{the above term is close quarters combat, and this temr is more like hand-to-hand fighting/scuffling/brawling. its less formal}

00:21:29.430 --> 00:21:31.600
There's no time for analysis!

00:21:43.900 --> 00:21:44.860
It's gone...

00:21:54.250 --> 00:21:58.000
Unidentified mobile suit that destroyed our city!

00:21:58.000 --> 00:22:00.500
You are completely surrounded!

00:22:01.460 --> 00:22:03.130
Do not resist!

00:22:03.130 --> 00:22:05.380
You're wrong! It was the UE!

00:22:05.380 --> 00:22:08.800
If I didn't fight, there would've been even more damage!

00:22:08.800 --> 00:22:10.510
You're under arrest!

00:22:10.510 --> 00:22:12.470
What the heck?!

00:22:13.470 --> 00:22:15.890
This is an interesting turn of events. {this is an interesting development/turn of events}

00:22:17.350 --> 00:22:18.020
Flit!

00:22:18.020 --> 00:22:20.480
Zalam caught him. {he was captured by Zalam}

00:22:21.230 --> 00:22:23.650
No. It's not like that!

00:22:23.650 --> 00:22:27.280
I... I protected the city!{no you didn't lololol}

